    "## 4. Chronological development/test split\n",
    "\n",
    "After warm-up, split the 459 eligible complete sessions chronologically: 321 development sessions and 138 test sessions. Development: 21 November 2024–13 March 2026. Test: 16 March–30 September 2026. No random shuffling is used.\n",
    "\n",
    "For this rule-based model, development does not require ML fitting. Indicators can update in the test period using previously observed sessions; rules do not change based on test outcomes.\n"
   ]
