    "## 13. Trade verification\n",
    "\n",
    "Check entry direction against the completed signal bar, the preceding confirmation signal, next-bar opening fills, exit conditions, same-day liquidation and trade accounting. The saved run passed checks for 287/176 development trades and 132/82 test trades (baseline/confirmation). These checks validate selected invariants, not every possible model defect or actual executable prices.\n",
    "\n",
    "These checks confirm that each recorded trade is valid. They cannot detect a trade that should have happened but did not. For that, the trade lists were also compared with an independently written implementation of the same rules (identical for all four runs).\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-09T02:07:56.798175Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-09T02:07:56.797923Z",
